    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Prefix sum</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Binary search</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Randomised</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/random-pick-with-weight/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 528</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Random Pick with Weight</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Lay the weights end to end as a line of tickets, draw one ticket uniformly, and binary-search the prefix sums for the block that holds it. O(n) to build, O(log n) per pick, and the probability of index i is exactly w[i] / total by construction.</p>\n"
